            "description": "Tokenizes one or more Masking items. LEFT/RIGHT use Length from 0 through Text length; MID uses Position `from:to` with 1<=from<=to<=Text length. Other Format values use a same-length `$` mask / `%` keep pattern. Requires at least one item; empty Masking returns 400 (code 1066), `Masking wajib berisi minimal satu item`. Invalid lengths, positions, or patterns return 400. 200 returns Ciphertext items with text."
          },
