            "description": "Generates a TOTP secret for AccountName (required, at most 128 bytes); invalid input returns 400 (code 1066), `AccountName wajib diisi, maks 128 byte`. 200 returns SecretEncrypted and `TOTP Key` (an otpauth URL). Crypto/input errors return 501; key zone or audit unavailability returns 503."
