            "description": "Validates SecretEncrypted and a six-digit CodeOTP. Either empty returns 400 (code 1066), `SecretEncrypted dan CodeOTP wajib diisi`. Non-six-digit input returns 200 with valid false; bad SecretEncrypted returns 501, `ciphertext tidak valid`. A code/step replay is rejected for 90 seconds. 200 valid is boolean."
